[+ sc_display +] will, at the cost of 4 stamina, make friends with the selected individual. They will be so jolly and whimsical together, that when taking actions together, they will harmonize their actions together and dunk on whoever stands in their way. This is the power, my friend, of socialization. Who should we socialize with?

</div>

- #combatant

